{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56900","headline":"抚州民爲千金陂谣（题从《古谣谚》卷八一拟） 一 · 佚名","name":"抚州民爲千金陂谣（题从《古谣谚》卷八一拟） 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公倅景城，民苏南皮。\n南皮斗门，厥绩今存。\n在昔河流，西走燕魏，民困堤防，日忧理水。\n舟楫壅遏，爲弊仍岁。\n公作斗门，分水之势，亦不役民，荷公之制。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"佚名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56900.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56900","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}